      "source_VERIFIED_or_global": false,
      "theorem_delta": "theorem actual_cosine_frame_gram {d q : ℕ} (hq : 2 * q + 1 < d) :\n  let θ : Fin d → ℝ := fun i => ((i.val : ℝ) + 1 / 2) * Real.pi / (d : ℝ)\n  let t : Matrix (Fin d) (Fin (q + 1)) ℝ := fun i k =>\n    if k.val = 0 then 1 else Real.sqrt 2 * Real.cos ((k.val : ℝ) * θ i)\n  let D : Matrix (Fin d) (Fin d) ℝ :=\n    Matrix.diagonal (fun i => Real.cos (((2 * q + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * θ i))\n  t.transpose * t = (d : ℝ) • (1 : Matrix (Fin (q + 1)) (Fin (q + 1)) ℝ) ∧\n    t.transpose * D * t = 0 ∧\n    ∀ i : Fin d, ∑ k : Fin (q + 1), (t i k) ^ 2 ≤ 2 * ((q : ℝ) + 1)\n",
      "truth_boundary": "Selected deterministic cosine-frame part of FactC.5 and a genuine private actual standard-Gaussian entrywise Gram integrability/mean application. Range(B)=Krylov, FactC.6 concentration and a source-valid absoluteC, full Lemma4.4, random-coefficient expectation factorization, deferred-Haar/adaptive/oracle/TV/precision/deterministic worst-query-cap/explicit expected-cost adapters, both main lower bounds and global reader delivery/purification/Goal acceptance remain separate. The source C6 Ex125 original-mean connection is context only, not a required formal AND parent here."
    },
